---
// PLATE II — hierarchical memory: fast capture, slow consolidation, recall.
// Engineering-drawing emulation of the "II — Hierarchical memory" region of
// plate-full.png (drawing no. LH-ARCH-001). Five group containers, all memory-cyan
// (`mem` @theme token); the numbered badges ①–⑤ trace ONE FACT's path, USER FLOW
// FIRST: ① as you work, bus events hit the capture gates → ② below-line writes land
// in the store → ③ while idle, the sleep pass files them → ④ chapters/lessons cross
// the line → ⑤ next sitting, recall injects — back to Plate I (accent-green chip).
// v0.9.0 (2026-07-11) LANDED the formerly on-branch work: idle_llm, the whole
// semanticizer group, and the chapters-first recall order are SHIPPED and default-on
// (hatches + LANDING tags removed; re-verified against origin/main @ v0.9.0 —
// load_context now renders "### Knowledge" chapters before facts, SEMA-04).
// mining lifts to ·65; reconciliation has three outcomes (CONFIRM / REVERT /
// UNDECIDED); the "first-move prevention" planned strip is omitted entirely.
// All labels source-true. No hardcoded colour; square corners.
// Marker ids p2-*. SVG at sm+; FlowLedger rail below sm carries the same story.
import FlowLedger from './FlowLedger.astro';
